  "history_export_limits": [
    "Watering and diagnostics are bounded rolling logs; older rotated records are unavailable through the live API.",
    "Moisture queries are capped at 1,000 output points. Above that input count, timestamps, raw values and percentages are averaged into time buckets.",
    "No raw-file, start/end, or pagination endpoint is exposed by this firmware. The 365-day and detailed retained responses are averaged; recent 41/40-day responses have hourly cadence and match on overlap.",
    "earlier-records-2026-09-05.json preserves the previously saved local archive, including planter and observation records no longer exposed by the current firmware."
